# Round 96: the round-95 callee-before-argument split was gated on the
# argument CONTAINING A CALL, but the VM loads the callee first ALWAYS --
# and an argument with no call can still raise. `nosuch of alsonosuch`
# reported the ARGUMENT's undefined name where the VM names the callee
# (same stdout, same rc, wrong message -- and the _err tier compares
# message text). Resolution is unconditional now.
print of "start"
r is nosuch of alsonosuch
print of r
